<title>HONG KONG: Paribas sets warrants on Hang Seng Bank.</title>
<headline>Paribas sets warrants on Hang Seng Bank.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas Capital Markets Group Ltd intended to issue 37.50 million call warrants on shares of Hang Seng Bank Ltd, Paribas said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$90</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.3404</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  23.DEC.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> LLISTING DATE     22.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
